Description: An interface to 'Zonation' software, enabling users to run spatial 
 conservation prioritization workflows in 'R'. It streamlines input preparation, 
 execution, and post-processing, while supporting reproducibility and lowering the 
 entry barrier for learning, teaching, and research in conservation planning. 
 The methods implemented in 'Zonation' are described in Moilanen et al. (2022) <doi:10.1111/2041-210X.13819>. 
